<title>AUSTRIA: AUSTRIAN H1 C/A DEFICIT WIDENS TO 28.7 BLN ATS.</title>
<headline>AUSTRIAN H1 C/A DEFICIT WIDENS TO 28.7 BLN ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT	JUNE	 MAY	     JUNE 96</p>
